#!/bin/bash
# Provident Design Studio on this server: static files on 127.0.0.1:8800, published by ngrok at
# https://design-studio.ngrok-free.dev (Google sign-in, @providentestate.com only).
#   pds-studio start | stop | restart | status
D=$HOME/pds-deploy; L=$D/logs; mkdir -p "$L"
CFG=$HOME/.config/ngrok-pds/ngrok.yml
running() { pgrep -f "$1" >/dev/null; }
start() {
  running "pds-deploy/serve.py" || setsid nohup python3 "$D/serve.py" 8800 "$HOME/Provident-Design-Studio" >>"$L/serve.log" 2>&1 < /dev/null &
  running "ngrok-pds/ngrok.yml" || setsid nohup ngrok start --all --config "$CFG" --log "$L/ngrok.log" >/dev/null 2>&1 < /dev/null &
  sleep 3; status
}
stop() { pkill -f "pds-deploy/serve.py"; pkill -f "ngrok-pds/ngrok.yml"; echo stopped; }
status() {
  running "pds-deploy/serve.py" && echo "server: running (127.0.0.1:8800)" || echo "server: stopped"
  running "ngrok-pds/ngrok.yml" && echo "ngrok:  running (https://design-studio.ngrok-free.dev)" || echo "ngrok:  stopped"
}
case "$1" in start) start;; stop) stop;; restart) stop; sleep 1; start;; status) status;; *) echo "usage: $0 start|stop|restart|status";; esac
